{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-forecasting","title":"蒙特卡洛交付预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/monte-carlo-forecasting","wordCount":1801,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"蒙特卡洛交付预测\">蒙特卡洛交付预测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>蒙特卡洛交付预测将估算从&quot;猜一个数字&quot;转变为&quot;模拟一万种可能的未来&quot;。它基于团队历史吞吐量数据运行随机模拟，输出概率分布（P50/P85/P95）而非单点估计。三个数字取代无休止的排期争论：P50 做内部参考、P85 做管理层沟通、P95 签合同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从确定性排期到概率性预测\">从确定性排期到概率性预测</h2><p>1946 年，波兰数学家 Stanislaw Ulam 在术后康复期间频繁玩纸牌接龙游戏。他想知道某个特定牌局的胜率——尝试解析计算后发现组合空间过于庞大。他的解决方案：玩一千局，数赢了多少次。这个思路后来被他的同事 John von Neumann 应用于洛斯阿拉莫斯的核反应模拟，以赌城&quot;蒙特卡洛&quot;命名来保密。</p>\n<p>蒙特卡洛方法的核心思想完全一致地适用于软件交付预测：与其试图精确计算一个交付日期，不如模拟一万种可能的未来，然后统计结果的分布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[历史吞吐量数据] --&gt; B[构建经验分布]&#10;    B --&gt; C[设定剩余工作量]&#10;    C --&gt; D{模拟 10000 次}&#10;    D --&gt; E[随机抽取一个 Sprint 吞吐量]&#10;    E --&gt; F[从剩余工作中减去]&#10;    F --&gt; G{剩余 ≤ 0?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| E&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[记录完成所需 Sprint 数]&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; I[生成累积概率分布]&#10;    I --&gt; J[输出 P50/P85/P95]\">flowchart TD\n    A[历史吞吐量数据] --&gt; B[构建经验分布]\n    B --&gt; C[设定剩余工作量]\n    C --&gt; D{模拟 10000 次}\n    D --&gt; E[随机抽取一个 Sprint 吞吐量]\n    E --&gt; F[从剩余工作中减去]\n    F --&gt; G{剩余 ≤ 0?}\n    G --&gt;|否| E\n    G --&gt;|是| H[记录完成所需 Sprint 数]\n    H --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; I[生成累积概率分布]\n    I --&gt; J[输出 P50/P85/P95]</pre><h2 id=\"算法实现\">算法实现</h2><p>蒙特卡洛交付预测的基础算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>收集团队最近 N 个 Sprint 的吞吐量（完成的条目数或故事点数）</li>\n<li>确定剩余待完成的工作量（条目数）</li>\n<li>运行模拟（通常 10,000 次）：<ul>\n<li>从历史吞吐量中随机抽样（有放回）</li>\n<li>逐 Sprint 递减剩余工作量</li>\n<li>记录到达零所需的 Sprint 数</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>统计所有模拟的结果分布</li>\n<li>输出关键百分位数</li>\n</ol>\n<p>数学表达：设历史吞吐量为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{t_1, t_2, ..., t_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，剩余工作量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次模拟中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>:</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>W</mi><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k = \\min\\left\\{m : \\sum_{j=1}^{m} t_{r_j} \\geq W\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{r_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9624em;vertical-align:-0.3473em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从历史数据中第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 次随机抽样的值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次模拟的完成 Sprint 数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>百分位数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P50</td>\n<td>50% 模拟在此前完成</td>\n<td>内部&quot;理想情况&quot;参考，不做外部承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P85</td>\n<td>85% 模拟在此前完成</td>\n<td>向管理层汇报的推荐日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P95</td>\n<td>95% 模拟在此前完成</td>\n<td>合同约定、公开发布日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50-P85 差值</td>\n<td>不确定性宽度</td>\n<td>团队可预测性的度量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据要求与质量\">数据要求与质量</h2><p>蒙特卡洛预测的质量完全取决于输入数据的代表性。关键考量：</p>\n<p><strong>最少数据量</strong>：研究表明从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> Sprint 增加到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> Sprint，预测精度提升约 70%。少于 8 个 Sprint 的数据应被视为不可靠——此时可退化为确定性方法（取中位数作为固定速率）。</p>\n<p><strong>数据新鲜度</strong>：团队能力不是静态的。3 个月前的吞吐量可能因为人员变动、技术债务累积或流程改进而不再代表当前状态。推荐使用最近 8-12 个 Sprint 的数据，或者对近期数据赋予更高权重。</p>\n<p><strong>异常值处理</strong>：团队偶尔会有异常高或异常低的 Sprint（如节假日周、全员 oncall）。有两种处理策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保留：让模拟自然包含这些极端情况（更保守）</li>\n<li>剔除：如果异常原因明确且不会再次发生（如一次性事件）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV = \\frac{\\sigma_{throughput}}{\\mu_{throughput}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0797em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>波动系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是预测宽度的主要驱动因素。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 翻倍时，预测范围扩大约 49%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 输入质量检查&#10;    A[Sprint 数量 ≥ 12?] --&gt;|否| B[退化为确定性方法]&#10;    A --&gt;|是| C[计算 CV]&#10;    C --&gt; D{CV &lt; 30%?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[标准蒙特卡洛]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[高波动警告 + 扩大样本]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 结果校准&#10;    E --&gt; G[输出百分位数]&#10;    G --&gt; H[与历史准确性对比]&#10;    H --&gt; I[调整采样策略]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 输入质量检查\n    A[Sprint 数量 ≥ 12?] --&gt;|否| B[退化为确定性方法]\n    A --&gt;|是| C[计算 CV]\n    C --&gt; D{CV &lt; 30%?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[标准蒙特卡洛]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[高波动警告 + 扩大样本]\n    end\n    subgraph 结果校准\n    E --&gt; G[输出百分位数]\n    G --&gt; H[与历史准确性对比]\n    H --&gt; I[调整采样策略]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"双层不确定性传播\">双层不确定性传播</h2><p>2026 年的研究将传统的单层蒙特卡洛扩展为双层模型：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：参数不确定性</strong>\n吞吐量的趋势不一定是平坦的——团队可能在持续改善或退化。使用 OLS 回归拟合趋势时，回归系数本身有置信区间。通过从系数的多元正态分布中采样来传播这一层不确定性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta} \\sim N(\\beta, \\Sigma_\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第二层：残差随机性</strong>\n即使趋势已知，每个 Sprint 的实际吞吐量仍有随机波动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon \\sim N(0, \\hat{\\sigma}^2_{residual})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>双层模型的关键见解：在数据稀疏时（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &lt; 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>），参数不确定性是预测宽度的主要贡献者；在数据充足时（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>），残差随机性主导。忽略参数不确定性会导致预测区间过窄——看起来精确但实际上过度自信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践指南-三个数字取代所有争论\">实践指南：三个数字取代所有争论</h2><p>蒙特卡洛预测的最大实践价值是它用三个数字终结了无休止的排期争论：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐百分位</th>\n<th>对话示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VP 问&quot;什么时候完&quot;</td>\n<td>P85</td>\n<td>&quot;基于数据，85% 概率在第 8 个 Sprint 前完成&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同/SOW</td>\n<td>P95</td>\n<td>&quot;我们签约按 Sprint 10 交付，有 95% 把握&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部规划</td>\n<td>P50</td>\n<td>&quot;最可能在 Sprint 6 完成，但别把它当承诺&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资决策</td>\n<td>P50+P85</td>\n<td>&quot;中位数 6 周，安全预算 9 周&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键实践原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>永远不要承诺 P50</strong>：P50 意味着 50% 的概率会超期——这不是一个可接受的承诺基础</li>\n<li><strong>向利益相关方展示分布而非单点</strong>：教育他们理解&quot;70% 概率在 8 月前、90% 在 9 月前&quot;比&quot;8 月 15 日&quot;更诚实也更有用</li>\n<li><strong>定期更新</strong>：每个 Sprint 结束后用新数据重新运行模拟，预测区间会随着工作推进而收窄</li>\n<li><strong>将预测与实际绘制在同一图表上</strong>：这是最强大的沟通工具——它让利益相关方直观看到预测的准确性</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"与故事点估算的关系\">与故事点估算的关系</h2><p>蒙特卡洛预测可以完全脱离故事点运行——只需要&quot;每个 Sprint 完成了多少个条目&quot;这一个数据点。这正是 #NoEstimates 运动推崇的路径：不估算单个条目的大小，而是通过历史吞吐量的统计特性预测未来。</p>\n<p>两种输入模式的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>前提条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>故事点速率</td>\n<td>考虑了条目间的大小差异</td>\n<td>需要估算环节</td>\n<td>条目大小差异显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条目计数</td>\n<td>零估算开销</td>\n<td>假设条目大小均匀</td>\n<td>条目已切到相似粒度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中，如果团队能将大多数故事切到 1-3 点（差异不超过 3 倍），纯计数方法与基于故事点的方法预测精度差异不大。这为&quot;不估算、只切片&quot;的工作流提供了理论支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>蒙特卡洛预测是当前最强大的交付日期预测工具——它不假设分布形式、能处理波动性、输出概率区间而非单点。其核心要求是充足的历史数据（≥12 Sprint）和合理的数据质量。双层不确定性模型进一步提升了预测的诚实度。在实践中，它用三个数字（P50/P85/P95）终结了无休止的排期争论，将对话从&quot;什么时候能完&quot;转变为&quot;你愿意接受多少风险&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"story-points-relative\">故事点与相对估算</a> 讨论了蒙特卡洛的输入数据如何从 Sprint 规划中产生；<a href=\"reference-class-forecasting\">参考类预测</a> 提供了另一种概率化预测方法，适用于缺乏团队历史数据的场景。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蒙特卡洛交付预测","id":"蒙特卡洛交付预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从确定性排期到概率性预测","id":"从确定性排期到概率性预测"},{"level":2,"text":"算法实现","id":"算法实现"},{"level":2,"text":"数据要求与质量","id":"数据要求与质量"},{"level":2,"text":"双层不确定性传播","id":"双层不确定性传播"},{"level":2,"text":"实践指南：三个数字取代所有争论","id":"实践指南-三个数字取代所有争论"},{"level":2,"text":"与故事点估算的关系","id":"与故事点估算的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"故事点与相对估算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/story-points-relative"},"next":{"title":"参考类预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/methods/reference-class-forecasting"}}